{"text": "Khat is a digital messaging platform that prioritizes privacy and allows users to share personal or confidential messages securely.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Khat prevents screenshots and forwards, ensuring conversations are securely locked between sender and receiver.", "dimensions": ["innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Khat is designed for meaningful, private exchanges, mimicking the experience of letter writing.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Key features of Khat include messages that self-delete after reading and acceptance codes to ensure only the intended recipient can read the message.", "dimensions": ["innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Khat includes AI-driven spam protection.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Khat provides a trusted platform for users as young as 12 to communicate openly.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding goal for Khat was $37,637.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Khat's funding period was from May 23, 2024, to July 11, 2024.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
