{"text": "Khat values a person's privacy more than anything else.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Khat aims to lock down conversations to remain between two people only - the sender and the receiver.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Khat is designed for longer conversations rather than simple and short exchanges.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Khat's existence will forever remain between the two individuals involved in the conversation.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The app is designed for longer conversations between two individuals, rather than simple and short exchanges.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The app aims to provide a personal hotline experience, allowing users to share their user ID with a select few trusted individuals.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The app seeks to normalize letter writing as a form of communication.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The app includes a feature that allows senders to delete messages after they have been read.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The app features an acceptance code that allows only the intended recipient to open a letter, with the letter being erased after three failed attempts to open it.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Users of the application can be as young as 12-13 years old.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The app features an 'acceptance code' that allows only the intended recipient to open a letter.", "dimensions": ["innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "If a letter marked for acceptance code is not opened more than three times, it will be erased.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The app is designed to help kids convey their feelings to parents, teachers, and mentors.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Only one recipient is allowed for each letter in the app.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Letters cannot be forwarded within the app.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Screenshots of letters cannot be taken, which is a secured feature of the app.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Users are identified by a username, which also serves as their mailbox address.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "There is no signup process using the username.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Attachments can be added to letters, requiring appropriate envelope and stationery based on size.", "dimensions": ["innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Letters go through an AI-enabled spam protection and classifier engine.", "dimensions": ["strategy", "innovation"], "type": "ai_model", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The classifier engine categorizes letters as urgent, serious, funny, abusive, or helpful.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Silent notifications are enabled within the app, indicated by a smiley on the app icon.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Users can enable acceptance codes for all conversations in their mailbox.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The app allows users to categorize messages as urgent, serious, funny, abusive, or helpful, using appropriate smileys.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "Silent notifications are enabled within the app, which will blink with a smiley on the app icon instead of showing who sent the last letter.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "Users can enable an acceptance code requirement for all conversations that arrive in their mailbox.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "Users can permanently block individuals sending hateful letters or blackmail, and this action cannot be reversed.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "The app prioritizes human emotions and privacy.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "The project faces risks and challenges including adding security layers for mailboxes.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "Getting certified by relevant authorities is a challenge for the project.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "The project requires GDPR certifications.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "The app needs a minimum of 50,000 CAD for development and marketing.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
{"text": "AI-generated content will be used in the spam protection and classifier designed within the application.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt53__openai", "chunk_index": 4, "char_start": 5600, "char_end": 7400}}
